    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1668">

                <pb facs="1420" n="1316" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1316"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 367.114M69/125.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Pera</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-05-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 15, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Fowle and Upham returned today.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d1668-f1"/> I will cable you
                    tomorrow the conclusions of their investigation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rockhill</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
